    "A short burst — jumping jacks, or sprint in place." : {
      "comment" : "Detail for the exercise step of the TIPP.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gerakan singkat — jumping jack, atau lari di tempat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Acting against a feeling that fits the facts just talks you out of a real signal. Problem-Solving Steps is the skill for this one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Melawan perasaan yang sudah sesuai fakta hanya membuatmu mengabaikan sinyal yang nyata. Langkah-Langkah Memecahkan Masalah adalah keterampilan yang tepat untuk ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a fact" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambah fakta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an idea" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambahkan ide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add at least two. The first idea is rarely the only one." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote displayed under a list of problem-solving",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambahkan setidaknya dua. Ide pertama jarang menjadi satu-satunya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add more if you have them — a silly one often loosens a better one." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote displayed under a list of options.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambahkan lagi jika ada — ide yang konyol sering kali membuka jalan bagi ide yang lebih baik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add plan" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambah rencana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also flagged" : {
      "comment" : "Heading for the other needs that also came back yes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Juga terdeteksi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And how much do you believe the original now?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dan seberapa besar kamu mempercayai pikiran awal itu sekarang?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anger" : {
      "comment" : "An emotion, in Opposite Action.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Marah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Angry" : {
      "comment" : "One of the four needs in the HALT check-in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Marah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything that doesn't fit. Exceptions count." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apa pun yang tidak sesuai. Pengecualian juga dihitung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apologise over and over, or avoid them entirely." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meminta maaf berulang-ulang, atau menghindari mereka sepenuhnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approach what you're avoiding. Slowly, and stay with it until the fear drops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dekati apa yang kamu hindari. Perlahan, dan bertahanlah sampai rasa takutnya mereda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
